heads/*:refs/heads/*`), moving `refs/heads/main` backward while Gerrit NoteDb still marked later changes MERGED.\n\n## Acceptance Criteria\n- [ ] Add or update the Gerrit object-store repair runbook to fetch recovery objects into a quarantine namespace, never directly into `refs/heads/*`.\n- [ ] Include a required pre/post checklist: EBS snapshots, expected old/new main SHAs, reachability of refs/changes, `git fsck --full --connectivity-only`, replication trigger, and merged-reachability check.\n- [ ] Add any lightweight script/guard that can reject or warn on a mirror recovery refspec that writes directly to protected branch refs.\n- [ ] Link the runbook/guard to the Mirror Guard merged-reachability invariant added during noolbenger.","env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","file_impact":[],"file_impact_scope":"undeclared","keyring":[],"managed_refs":[],"no_file_impact_reason":"","parent_id":null,"parent_status_uuid":"","plan_review_phase":"planning","preconditions_summary":{"status":"pre-manifest"},"priority":2,"repos":[],"reverts":[],"status":"open","tags":["gerrit","runbook","integrity"],"ticket_id":"c8dc-9fb2-ddfa-45d0","ticket_type":"task","title":"Document safe Gerrit object-store repair","verify_commands":[]},"source_event_uuids":["356ee97b-d9b7-4ab5-be31-873f197f622c","0570efd9-bd0c-49e5-99a9-b3d376ee4b08"]},"env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","event_type":"SNAPSHOT","timestamp":1788959647527152001,"uuid":"c7a41891-5e6e-45a7-85e2-b7b37d42e161"}